    "/v1/guardians/{guardian_id}/students/{student_id}/grades/{course_id}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "records"
        ],
        "summary": "Get Course Detail",
        "description": "One subject in detail — the figures behind \"why is her maths grade 72\".\n\nThe per-ASSESSMENT breakdown is not served yet, and returns an empty list rather\nthan a fabricated one. `local_schoolapi` summarises per subject; it has no\nper-assessment endpoint, and the core Moodle call that would provide one cannot\nexpress whether an assessment was excused — so a list built from it would show a\ncounted zero where the child was excused, which is precisely the error this system\nexists to prevent.\n\nAn empty list is honest but not harmless: the agent must say it does not have the\nbreakdown, NOT that there are no assessments. The template that renders this\ndistinguishes the two.\n\nThe subject-level figures below are complete and correct, so \"her maths is 72,\nwith one assessment excused and one still to be marked\" is answerable today; only\nthe item-by-item list is missing.",
        "operationId": "get_course_detail_v1_guardians__guardian_id__students__student_id__grades__course_id__get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "guardian_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Guardian Id"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "student_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Student Id"
            }
          },
