          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "title": "GradeCategory",
        "description": "A gradebook category subtotal, computed by the system of record.\n\nExact under every aggregation scheme, because the LMS applied that scheme itself.\nThis is the dependable route to a partial subject grade when `academic` could not\nbe derived."
      },
